OL,5,G2200 Highway Thru Hell
OL,6,     FJamie's new BC crew struggles with
OL,7,     Fa badly mangled trailer on a
OL,8,     Fdangerous blind corner. When Colin
OL,9,     Fslips up on a big recovery in
OL,10,     FAlberta, Jamie's brother has to
OL,11,     Ftake over the job.
OL,12,G2300 The X-Files
OL,13,     FReyes suspects that a maniacal
OL,14,     Fkiller, who critically wounds
OL,15,     FDoggett, may have entered our
OL,16,     Fworld from a parallel dimension.
OL,17,G0000 Cops
OL,18,     FA nervous driver blows smoke at
OL,19,     Fdeputies and refuses to exit her
OL,20,     Ftruck. A domestic violence suspect
OL,21,     Ftalks in circles when questioned.
