OL,5,G0200 Trucking Hell
OL,6,     FA 40-tonne lorry careers off the
OL,7,     FM1 and plunges down an embankment,
OL,8,     Fbecoming embedded in a ditch.
OL,9,     FSteve needs to work out how to
OL,10,     Ffree the truck, preventing it from
OL,11,     Ffalling on its side.
OL,12,G0300 Trucking Hell
OL,13,     FOn the M11, a fully loaded truck
OL,14,     Fpulling an extra trailer has been
OL,15,     Fleft marooned after a rear axle
OL,16,     Fcollapsed while at full speed.
OL,17,     FAlpha recovery deal with a
OL,18,     Fmotorhome gutted by fire.
